    private function legalOptions(array$options,string$selected): string {$html='';foreach($options as$value=>$label)$html.='<option value="'.View::e($value).'"'.($selected===(string)$value?' selected':'').'>'.View::e($label).'</option>';return$html;}
    private function legalDirectorateOptions(int$selected=0): string {$html='';foreach($this->db->all('SELECT id,code,name FROM directorates WHERE active=1 ORDER BY name')as$row)$html.='<option value="'.(int)$row['id'].'"'.($selected===(int)$row['id']?' selected':'').'>'.View::e($row['code'].' · '.$row['name']).'</option>';return$html;}
    private function legalStaffOptions(int$selected=0): string {$html='';foreach($this->db->all("SELECT DISTINCT u.id,u.name,r.name role_name FROM users u JOIN user_role_scopes urs ON urs.user_id=u.id JOIN roles r ON r.id=urs.role_id JOIN directorates d ON d.id=urs.directorate_id WHERE u.status='active' AND d.code='PRAV' AND COALESCE(r.base_role_code,r.code) IN('legal_office','legal_director','senior_legal_officer','legal_officer','legal_assistant') AND (urs.valid_from IS NULL OR urs.valid_from<=SYSUTCDATETIME()) AND (urs.valid_to IS NULL OR urs.valid_to>=SYSUTCDATETIME()) ORDER BY u.name")as$row)$html.='<option value="'.(int)$row['id'].'"'.($selected===(int)$row['id']?' selected':'').'>'.View::e($row['name'].' · '.$row['role_name']).'</option>';return$html;}
    private function legalProcurementOptions(int$selected=0): string {$html='';foreach($this->db->all('SELECT TOP 3000 id,procurement_code,contract_code,contract_title,contracting_party FROM procurement_projects ORDER BY procurement_code,contract_code')as$row)$html.='<option value="'.(int)$row['id'].'"'.($selected===(int)$row['id']?' selected':'').'>'.View::e($row['procurement_code'].' · '.($row['contract_code']?:$row['contract_title']).' · '.$row['contracting_party']).'</option>';return$html;}
    private function legalBudgetOptions(int$selected=0): string {$html='';foreach($this->db->all('SELECT TOP 5000 bl.id,bl.code,bl.name,d.code directorate_code,bc.base_year FROM budget_lines bl JOIN budget_versions bv ON bv.id=bl.budget_version_id AND bv.is_official=1 JOIN budget_cycles bc ON bc.id=bv.budget_cycle_id JOIN directorates d ON d.id=bl.directorate_id ORDER BY bc.base_year DESC,d.code,bl.code')as$row)$html.='<option value="'.(int)$row['id'].'"'.($selected===(int)$row['id']?' selected':'').'>'.View::e($row['base_year'].' · '.$row['directorate_code'].' · '.$row['code'].' · '.$row['name']).'</option>';return$html;}
    private function legalProjectOptions(int$selected=0): string {$html='';foreach($this->db->all('SELECT TOP 3000 id,code,name FROM projects ORDER BY code,name')as$row)$html.='<option value="'.(int)$row['id'].'"'.($selected===(int)$row['id']?' selected':'').'>'.View::e($row['code'].' · '.$row['name']).'</option>';return$html;}
